 "description": "Use this when someone asks what clearance or hole size to draw for a printed fit: a sliding part, a bolt or pin through a hole, two printed parts that mate, a press fit, or a snap fit. It returns published starting clearances and hole guidance, each with its source, and how to test the fit. It gives no single universal hole offset, because none is published.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
